{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "scope": "Explicit NEOS MID360 directed simulation qualification only. Uses a 5m half-width posterior with full admitted-domain geometric refinement, cautious unmodeled compact-object approach, current confirmed motion identity ownership and domain-limited sim observation repeatability. Nominal pure input dead times are speed=0s and steering=0.06s, separately from 1.2m/s2 and 4rad/s slew, identified from one unloaded flat simulation trace on 2026-11-16. Qualification remains incomplete; not real-vehicle deployment, worst-case latency calibration, calibrated human prediction or a 20ms timing guarantee.",
